  "editorial": {
    "name": "About the lab - Material UI",
    "descriptionZh": "MUI 的实验包说明页：@mui/lab 装的是还没准备好进核心的孵化组件，因为单独发包允许在必要时发破坏性变更；页面把组件从 lab 升进 core 的判定标准逐条写清楚。",
    "takeawayZh": "读清 lab 与 core 的版本差异，再决定要不要用。",
    "noteZh": "正文第一段说 The main difference between the lab and the core is how the components are versioned，第三段开始列进 core 的条件：It needs to be used，作者说他们用 Google Analytics 在文档里评估每个组件的用量，接着才是 code quality、type definitions、test coverage 三条。左侧导航把 LAB 组单独放在 About the lab、Masonry、Timeline 三项下，右侧 CONTENTS 只有 Installation 与 TypeScript 两条。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
